---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Waypoint, who we are and how we work.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About us</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Waypoint was founded to give people a steady point of reference when things feel uncertain. This page
        will tell the full story once the copy is ready.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are a small, independent team with a background in planning, delivery and customer service. We
        believe good advice should be honest, well organised and easy to follow.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>Our approach rests on three simple principles, described below as placeholder content.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Listen first</h3>
          <p>Every project starts with a conversation about where you are today and where you want to be.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Plan together</h3>
          <p>We shape the route with you, agreeing clear milestones and a well-defined scope from the outset.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Stay alongside</h3>
          <p>We check in regularly, adjust the plan when needed and make sure progress keeps moving forward.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
